3 weapon);16052g 5s 3c;10286g 6s;This battered weapon once belonged to the legendary warrior Marget Yarren, who perished in the Whispering Woods.;Large Iron Box;1g 9s 9c;1g 5s 3c;100 lb.;Musical Instrument (Bassoon);121g 1s 4c;101g 1s 4c; A large woodwind instrument with a double reed mouthpiece and long, folded tube, played by blowing air through the reeds.;Musical Instrument (Concertina);58g 6s 2c;39g 4s 6c; A small, hexagonal accordion-like instrument with buttons on both ends, producing sound by pressing buttons and squeezing the bellows.;Musical Instrument (Cymbals);3g 1c;2g 1s 1c; A pair of metal plates that produce a crashing sound when struck together, used for rhythmic accompaniment.;Musical Instrument (Harmonica);3g 6s 2c;2g 5s 4c; A small, handheld wind instrument with reed plates inside, played by blowing and drawing air through the holes.;Musical Instrument (Horn);1g 5s 3c;1g 8c; A brass instrument with a flared bell and tubing, played by buzzing the lips into a mouthpiece.;Musical Instrument (Sitar);78g 7s 6c;61g 7s 5c; A stringed instrument with a long neck and pear-shaped body, played by plucking or strumming.;Potion of Darkvision;307g 9s 8c;197g 3s 1c;This glowing elixir causes shadows to appear darker when used.;Potion of Giant Strength;332g 2s 4c;241g 2s 5c;Increases strength to 21 for 1 hour.;Ring of Climbing;2390g 8s 3c;1931g 5s 8c;This battered ring is said to grant a single wish once every score of years.;Siangham (Small);56200g 2s;44556g 7c;(+5 weapon) A finely crafted weapon, engraved with runes of death.;Skooma;49g 2s 6c;37g 5s;For 8 hours, gain advantage on all Charisma checks but disadvantage on all Intelligence, Dexterity, and Wisdom checks.;Staff of Abjuration (16 of 50 charges);12062g 1s;7821g 9s 5c;This masterwork staff is said to be imbued with thesirit of the renowned wizard Amrad, who slew the Leviathan of the Sea of Lauce. (design provides clue to function);Staff of Size Alteration;17091g 5s 6c;14268g 5s 9c;(27 of 50 charges) This elm staff once belonged to the legendary sorcerer Getema, who vanished in the Lair of the Wyrm Duke.;True Wand;31692g 4s 7c;22274g 7s 7c;This wand can be used as an arcane focus. If you can castsells with an arcane focus and use this wand for yoursells, yoursells require no material components that cost less than 1000g. Additionally, when you cast asell using this wand as your arcane focus, roll an ability check with yoursellcasting ability score. If you roll higher than 11 + thesell's level, you cast thesell without using asellslot. This fails if you have nosellslots remaining of thesell's level and therefore couldn't cast without succeeding.;Wand of Lightning Bolts;15863g 4s 2c;12112g 5s 7c;This wand can unleash powerful bolts of lightning upon command.;Whispering Wind Chime;56g 7s 3c;49g 2s 1c; A set of wind chimes that emit soothing whispers when stirred by the breeze.;Whispersilk Cloak;208g 1s 2c;143g 9s 5c; A cloak made of enchanted silk that muffles sound and grants the wearer increased stealth.;White Onyx;62g 3s 9c;50g 2s 4c;--;yellow Quartz;51g 1s 6c;34g 2c;--
